# Scale Up reads "target creature you control" (CR 115.1): it can be aimed at Bot1's own Ornithopter and not at Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Scale Up
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Scale Up.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Scale Up.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 6
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
